    summary: "HTML is structure, CSS is presentation, the DOM is both made live. Read forms, inputs, and scripts as security decisions — because attackers read them exactly that way, on systems they are authorized to assess or not at all.",
    skillGained: "Web page literacy: HTML/CSS/DOM reading for assessment.",
